{
  "id": "481",
  "title": "Neighbor Gossip",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-04-08",
  "synopsis": "Little He overhears his neighbor shouting, which awakes his appetite for gossip.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/699/90fc20bbd17daf9549270a6dbce655f0aa9eef3f.mp3?1522072773",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "什么关系？\n\n    晚上10点多，小何听到楼上传来一个女人的叫骂声：“什么关系？说！到底是什么关系？”\n    小何以为是楼上的男人有小三被女人发现了，女人正在问男人“他们是什么关系”。小何八卦心起，走到窗边，竖起耳朵，认真地听着下文。\n    女人继续生气地喊道：“什么关系？那么简单的题都不会！它们互为相反数啊！”\n    原来是女人在教孩子做作业啊！小何默默地关上了窗户。",
    "traditional": "什麼關係？\n\n    晚上10點多，小何聽到樓上傳來一個女人的叫罵聲：“什麼關係？說！到底是什麼關係？”\n    小何以為是樓上的男人有小三被女人發現了，女人正在問男人“他們是什麼關係”。小何八卦心起，走到窗邊，豎起耳朵，認真地聽著下文。\n    女人繼續生氣地喊道：“什麼關係？那麼簡單的題都不會！它們互為相反數啊！”\n    原來是女人在教孩子做作業啊！小何默默地關上了窗戶。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What's the relationship?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "晚上10点多，小何听到楼上传来一个女人的叫骂声：",
      "traditional": "晚上10點多，小何聽到樓上傳來一個女人的叫罵聲：",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang 1 diǎn duō xiǎo hé tīng dào lóu shàng chuán lái yí ge nǚ rén de jiào mà shēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“什么关系？说！到底是什么关系？”",
      "traditional": "“什麼關係？說！到底是什麼關係？”",
      "pinyin": "shén me guān xi shuō dào dǐ shì shén me guān xi",
      "english": "It was past 10 in the evening when Little He heard a female scolding voice shouting upstairs:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“What's the relationship? Tell me! What is the relationship really?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小何以为是楼上的男人有小三被女人发现了，",
      "traditional": "小何以為是樓上的男人有小三被女人發現了，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé yǐ wéi shì lóu shàng de nán rén yǒu xiǎo sān bèi nǚ rén fā xiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "女人正在问男人“他们是什么关系”。",
      "traditional": "女人正在問男人“他們是什麼關係”。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén zhèng zài wèn nán rén tā men shì shén me guān xi",
      "english": "Little He thought the man upstairs had a mistress and had been discovered by the woman."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小何八卦心起，",
      "traditional": "小何八卦心起，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé bā guà xīn qǐ",
      "english": "And that the woman was asking the man: “What's the relationship between the two of you?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "走到窗边，竖起耳朵，认真地听着下文。",
      "traditional": "走到窗邊，豎起耳朵，認真地聽著下文。",
      "pinyin": "zǒu dào chuāng biān shù qǐ ěr duo rèn zhēn de tīng zhe xià wén",
      "english": "Little He's appetite for gossip arose."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He walked up to the window and focused his ears, carefully listening to the following conversation."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "女人继续生气地喊道：",
      "traditional": "女人繼續生氣地喊道：",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén jì xù shēng qì de hǎn dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "“什么关系？那么简单的题都不会！它们互为相反数啊！”",
      "traditional": "“什麼關係？那麼簡單的題都不會！它們互為相反數啊！”",
      "pinyin": "shén me guān xi nà me jiǎn dān de tí dōu bú huì tā men hù wéi xiāng fǎn shù a",
      "english": "The woman continued to shout angrily:"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“What's the relationship? You can't even solve such a simple problem! They're additive inverses!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "原来是女人在教孩子做作业啊！",
      "traditional": "原來是女人在教孩子做作業啊！",
      "pinyin": "yuán lái shì nǚ rén zài jiāo hái zi zuò zuò yè a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小何默默地关上了窗户。",
      "traditional": "小何默默地關上了窗戶。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé mò mò de guān shàng le chuāng hu",
      "english": "It turns out the woman was helping her child with homework!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He quietly closed the window."
    }
  ],
